=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tips\">Tips</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Alien Blaster is effective at dealing with <a href=\"/wiki/The_Void\" title=\"The Void\">Darklings</a> due to its ability to pass through walls.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Like every limited item in the game, the Alien Blaster <i><u>can be purchased from player shops.</u></i></li></ul>\n<ul><li>Uniquely, the Alien Blaster does <i>not</i> have most projectile weapons' lock-on, making it less effective for crowd control but better at picking off singular targets.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260830203951\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 82/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 71/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019491/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   25.667      1 Template:Tool\n100.00%   25.667      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4296-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260830203951 and revision id 22086. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Infobox_templates"],"links":[{"title":"The Void","exists":true}],"images":["Alienblaster.png"]}
